##! Please refer to the documentation at
##! https://coreruleset.org/docs/development/regex_assembly/.

##! MySQL/MariaDB character set introducer: `_charset'literal'`,
##! `_charset X'ff'`, `_charset 0x00`, `_charset b'1'`.
##! See https://github.com/coreruleset/coreruleset/pull/4906.

##!+ i

##!^ (?:^|[^0-9A-Z_a-z])_
##!$ [\s\x0b]*(?:'|[xb]'|0x[0-9a-f]|0b[01])

##!> include mysql-charset-names
